      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- put Kafka between ingestion and processing sized for a four-hour outage, so a slow search index causes lag rather\nthan loss, and a parser bug is recoverable by replaying from an earlier offset.\n- Independent consumers: Metrics and logs read the same stream at their own pace, and adding a third consumer later\ncosts nothing upstream.\n- Replay: A bug in the log parser is fixable by resetting the consumer offset and reprocessing, rather than by losing a\nday of data.\n- Backpressure: When the index is overwhelmed, consumers fall behind and the queue grows. Agents keep shipping\nsuccessfully, because the alternative is agents buffering on production hosts and eventually filling their disks.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- put Kafka between ingestion and processing sized for a four-hour outage, so a slow search index causes lag rather than loss, and a parser bug is recoverable by replaying from an earlier offset.\n- Independent consumers: Metrics and logs read the same stream at their own pace, and adding a third consumer later costs nothing upstream.\n- Replay: A bug in the log parser is fixable by resetting the consumer offset and reprocessing, rather than by losing a day of data.\n- Backpressure: When the index is overwhelmed, consumers fall behind and the queue grows. Agents keep shipping successfully, because the alternative is agents buffering on production hosts and eventually filling their disks.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
